# 35. Command Summary

| Command / Concept | Purpose |
|---|---|
| stdin | Standard input |
| stdout | Standard output |
| stderr | Standard error |
| 0 | stdin file descriptor |
| 1 | stdout file descriptor |
| 2 | stderr file descriptor |
| > | Redirect stdout and overwrite |
| >> | Redirect stdout and append |
| 2> | Redirect stderr |
| \| | Send output of one command to another |
| tee | Display and save output |
| tee -a | Display and append output |
| env | Display environment variables |
| $VARIABLE | Access variable value |
| export | Export a shell variable |
| cut | Extract fields or characters |
| paste | Combine lines from files |
| head | Display beginning of file |
| tail | Display end of file |
| tail -f | Continuously monitor a file |

